WEBVTT

00:02:56.788 --> 00:03:00.413
using gas chambers
or poisonous gas in conflicts...

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:02.621
All these actions,
when they are committed,

00:03:02.621 --> 00:03:04.788
constitute acts of war
and war crimes

00:03:04.788 --> 00:03:08.829
according to customary international law
and the Hague Conventions.

00:03:08.829 --> 00:03:11.996
Again, the current legal framework
remains silent

00:03:11.996 --> 00:03:15.204
on hypothetical questions
and countless others

00:03:15.204 --> 00:03:17.288
because there is no easy answer.

00:03:17.288 --> 00:03:20.288
There are only two ways
to make progress on these questions:

00:03:20.288 --> 00:03:22.496
peace or new laws.

00:03:22.496 --> 00:03:26.829
So what hypothetical, but plausible,
scenario can you imagine

00:03:26.829 --> 00:03:29.413
in this context of cyber warfare ?

00:03:29.413 --> 00:03:32.954
How to design 
an international legal framework